## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-world multi-tenant data governance, cross-region reliability, and operational controls.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant isolation and quota management
- Ordering guarantees within a tenant
- Deduplication with composite keys in DynamoDB
- Schema evolution via Glue Registry
- Cross-region replication and cost/latency trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: tenant-scoped routing logic and dedupe check
async function processEvent(evt){
  const key = `${evt.tenantId}#${evt.deviceId}#${evt.ts}`;
  const exists = await dynamo.get({Key: {pk: key}});
  if(exists){ return; }
  await dynamo.put({Item: {pk: key, ...evt}});
  // forward to region-specific S3 writer
}
```

